Accordingly, the following order:
ORDER (i) The criminal petition is allowed;
(ii) The entire criminal proceedings in S.C.No.304/2024 pending on the file of I Additional District and Sessions Judge, Kalaburagi, arising out of Crime No.27/2023 registered by Kalaburagi Women Police Station, for the offences punishable under Sections 498-A, 323, 307, 354, 504, 506 read with Section 149 of IPC and Sections 3 & 4 of Dowry Prohibition Act, as against the petitioners is quashed.

